; ============================================================
; THE BYZANTINE SHADOW
; 03C -- BYZANTINE UU DOCTRINE (CATAPHRACT / CAMEL / LOGISTICA)
; ============================================================
;
; Evidence class: BYZANTINE-GENERALIZATION over DIRECT stock
; corroboration (AI (HD version).per, Promiskuitiv). Every rule
; below mirrors an observed stock Byzantine behavior; nothing here
; is presented as donor (Shadow) behavior -- Shadow was Vikings-only
; and carries no Cataphract/camel doctrine.
;
; Stock-corroborated judgments implemented:
;   1. Cataphracts answer massed infantry (stock trains UU < 20 on
;      sn-infantry-threat >= 1 for Byzantine profiles;
;      AI (HD version).per:28295-28308) and eagle-warrior enemy
;      goal (28310-28322).
;   2. UU production seeds early for Byzantines: Castle threshold
;      < 5 vs < 12 general (29644-29653).
;   3. Knights de-emphasized once castled (Byzantine nand-guard on
;      the Castle knight rule, 29239-29251); knight requests map to
;      camels ("I'll focus on camels", 37730-37741).
;   4. Hand Cannoneers routed around, not through: the HC mass rule
;      excludes castled Byzantines (28637-28651) because the
;      anti-infantry answer is the UU. HC stays a secondary line.
;   5. UU-gold eco shift: UU plan + 2 castles reallocates gatherers
;      toward gold (45/27/25 stock shape, 33207-33220).
;   6. Logistica as late backstop on gold stockpile + population
;      scale (22763-22777); belief-driven demand (below) fires first.
;
; Engine notes: my-unique-unit-line / my-unique-research /
; my-unique-unit-upgrade resolve per-civilization (Cataphract /
; Logistica / Elite Cataphract for Byzantines). No hardcoded IDs.
;
; Loaded by ShadowByzantine.per after 03b_strategy_bootstrap.
; ============================================================

; ------------------------------------------------------------
; 1. CATAPHRACT SEED (early, Castle, low threshold)
; ------------------------------------------------------------
(defrule
    (current-age == castle-age)
    (building-type-count-total castle >= 1)
    (unit-type-count-total my-unique-unit-line < 5)
    (can-train my-unique-unit-line)
=>
    (train my-unique-unit-line)
)

; ------------------------------------------------------------
; 2. CATAPHRACT MASS (threat-driven: infantry masses + eagles)
; ------------------------------------------------------------
(defrule
    (current-age >= castle-age)
    (unit-type-count-total my-unique-unit-line < 20)
    (or	(players-unit-type-count any-enemy militiaman-line >= 6)
    (or	(players-unit-type-count any-enemy eagle-warrior-line >= 4)
    (players-unit-type-count any-enemy huskarl-line >= 4)))
    (or	(gold-amount > 100)
    (up-research-status c: my-unique-unit-upgrade >= research-pending))
    (can-train my-unique-unit-line)
=>
    (train my-unique-unit-line)
)

; ------------------------------------------------------------
; 3. LOGISTICA BACKSTOP (gold stockpile + population scale)
; ------------------------------------------------------------
(defrule
    (current-age >= castle-age)
    (current-age-time > 300)
    (population >= 100)
    (gold-amount > 800)
    (can-research-with-escrow my-unique-research)
=>
    (release-escrow wood)
    (release-escrow food)
    (release-escrow gold)
    (research my-unique-research)
)

; ------------------------------------------------------------
; 4. UU-GOLD ECO SHIFT (Cataphract demand + 2 castles)
; ------------------------------------------------------------
(defrule
    (current-age == castle-age)
    (unit-type-count-total my-unique-unit-line > 0)
    (building-type-count-total castle > 1)
    (unit-type-count-total villager > 20)
=>
    (set-strategic-number sn-food-gatherer-percentage 45)
    (set-strategic-number sn-wood-gatherer-percentage 27)
    (set-strategic-number sn-gold-gatherer-percentage 25)
    (set-strategic-number sn-stone-gatherer-percentage 3)
)

; Revert: no Cataphract demand active -> Castle baseline eco.
; Without this the UU-gold shift above latches forever once fired.
; Baseline is project policy (BYZANTINE-GENERALIZATION): food/wood
; trash economy with a standing gold share for monks/siege tech.
(defrule
    (current-age == castle-age)
    (unit-type-count-total my-unique-unit-line <= 0)
=>
    (set-strategic-number sn-food-gatherer-percentage 55)
    (set-strategic-number sn-wood-gatherer-percentage 35)
    (set-strategic-number sn-gold-gatherer-percentage 10)
    (set-strategic-number sn-stone-gatherer-percentage 0)
)

; ------------------------------------------------------------
; 5. TAUNT-250 KNIGHT REQUEST -> CAMELS (stock mapping verbatim
;    in behavior: Byzantines answer knight requests with camels)
; ------------------------------------------------------------
(defrule
    (or	(taunt-detected me 250)
    (taunt-detected any-ally 250))
    (civ-selected byzantine)
=>
    (chat-to-player me "I'll focus on camels.")
    (chat-to-player every-ally "I'll focus on camels.")
    (acknowledge-taunt me 250)
    (acknowledge-taunt any-ally 250)
    (set-goal BYZ-CAMEL-PLAN BYZ-CAMEL-REQUESTED)
)
